<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The Turning Point To better support Sam, the coach arranged a facilitated conversation with him and an advocate of his choice. Initially hesitant to disclose his diagnosis, Sam feared being defined by a label. However, with the support of a friend, he decided to share his diagnosis with the coach. Together, they explored how Sam's unique traits influenced his experience in a rugby setting. They identified sensory sensitivities as a significant challenge in group environments, with triggers like the sharp sound of whistles, the chaotic nature of group drills, and the texture of certain training gear causing Sam considerable discomfort.)
/E (The Turning Point To better support Sam, the coach arranged a facilitated conversation with him and an advocate of his choice. Initially hesitant to disclose his diagnosis, Sam feared being defined by a label. However, with the support of a friend, he decided to share his diagnosis with the coach. Together, they explored how Sam's unique traits influenced his experience in a rugby setting. They identified sensory sensitivities as a significant challenge in group environments, with triggers like the sharp sound of whistles, the chaotic nature of group drills, and the texture of certain training gear causing Sam considerable discomfort.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
