/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The Power of Inclusivity By providing tailored support and empowering Sam to self-advocate, the coach not only facilitated Sam's success in rugby but also contributed to his personal development. This example highlights how understanding, flexibility, and accommodations in sport can transform potential barriers into opportunities for achievement, reinforcing the power of inclusivity and support in helping autistic athletes succeed both on and off the field.)
/E (The Power of Inclusivity By providing tailored support and empowering Sam to self-advocate, the coach not only facilitated Sam's success in rugby but also contributed to his personal development. This example highlights how understanding, flexibility, and accommodations in sport can transform potential barriers into opportunities for achievement, reinforcing the power of inclusivity and support in helping autistic athletes succeed both on and off the field.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [2]
